    SMTPWorker -->|deliver| ExternalMTA[External Mail Servers]
    SMTPWorker -->|bounce handle| BounceDB[(PostgreSQL Bounces)]
    AttachSvc -->|upload| S3Attach[/S3 Attachments/]
    AttachSvc -->|scan| VirusScanner
    InboxSvc -->|read| MailDB
    InboxSvc -->|cache| InboxCache([Redis Inbox Cache])
    SearchSvc -->|query| ES
    KafkaInbound -->|consume| AnalyticsWorker[Analytics Worker]
    AnalyticsWorker -->|write| ClickHouse[(ClickHouse)]
    GW -->|metrics| Prom[Prometheus]
    Prom -->|alert| PagerDuty[PagerDuty]
    Prom -->|dashboard| Grafana[Grafana]

--- EXAMPLE 23: Blockchain/crypto exchange platform ---
flowchart TD
    TraderApp[Trader App] -->|HTTPS| GW{{API Gateway}}
    GW -->|auth 2FA| AuthSvc[Auth Service]
    AuthSvc -->|TOTP| TOTPCache([Redis TOTP])
    AuthSvc -->|session| SessionDB[(PostgreSQL Sessions)]
    GW -->|GET /orderbook| OrderBookSvc[Order Book Service]
    GW -->|POST /order| OrderSvc[Order Service]
    GW -->|GET /wallet| WalletSvc[Wallet Service]
    GW -->|POST /withdraw| WithdrawSvc[Withdrawal Service]
    GW -->|WebSocket /feed| PriceFeed[Price Feed Hub]
    OrderSvc -->|validate| RiskEngine[Risk Engine]
    RiskEngine -->|balance| WalletCache([Redis Wallet Balances])
    OrderSvc -->|submit| MatchEngine[Order Matching Engine]
    MatchEngine -->|order book| OrderBookCache([Redis Order Book])
    MatchEngine -->|fill| KafkaTrade>Kafka trade-events]
    KafkaTrade -->|consume| LedgerWorker[Ledger Worker]
    LedgerWorker -->|debit credit| LedgerDB[(PostgreSQL Ledger)]
    LedgerWorker -->|update balance| WalletCache
    KafkaTrade -->|consume| PriceFeed
    KafkaTrade -->|consume| SettlementWorker[Settlement Worker]
    SettlementWorker -->|on-chain tx| BlockchainNode[Blockchain Node]
    BlockchainNode -->|confirm| SettlementDB[(PostgreSQL Settlements)]
    WalletSvc -->|hot wallet| HSM[Hardware Security Module]
    WalletSvc -->|cold storage| ColdWallet[Cold Wallet Vault]
    WithdrawSvc -->|sign tx| HSM
    WithdrawSvc -->|broadcast| BlockchainNode
    WithdrawSvc -->|compliance| AMLSvc[AML Check Service]
    AMLSvc -->|screen| AMLProvider[Chainalysis API]
    KafkaTrade -->|consume| AnalyticsWorker[Analytics Worker]
    AnalyticsWorker -->|write| TimescaleDB[(TimescaleDB Prices)]
    GW -->|metrics| Prom[Prometheus]
    Prom -->|alert| PagerDuty[PagerDuty]
    GW -->|audit log| AuditDB[(PostgreSQL Audit)]
    Prom -->|dashboard| Grafana[Grafana]

--- EXAMPLE 24: ML training and serving platform like MLflow + Seldon ---
flowchart TD
    DataScientist[Data Scientist] -->|HTTPS| GW{{API Gateway}}
    GW -->|auth| AuthSvc[Auth Service]
    GW -->|POST /experiment| ExperimentSvc[Experiment Service]
    GW -->|POST /train| TrainSvc[Training Service]
    GW -->|POST /deploy| DeploySvc[Model Deploy Service]
    GW -->|POST /predict| PredictGW{{Prediction Gateway}}
    ExperimentSvc -->|track runs| MLFlowDB[(PostgreSQL MLflow)]
    ExperimentSvc -->|artifacts| S3Artifacts[/S3 Model Artifacts/]
    TrainSvc -->|queue job| TrainQueue>SQS Train Queue]
    TrainQueue -->|consume| TrainWorker1[GPU Worker 1]
    TrainQueue -->|consume| TrainWorker2[GPU Worker 2]
    TrainWorker1 -->|read data| DataLake[/S3 Data Lake/]
    TrainWorker1 -->|feature store| FeatureDB[(Redis Feature Store)]
    TrainWorker1 -->|log metrics| ExperimentSvc
    TrainWorker1 -->|save model| S3Artifacts
    TrainWorker2 -->|read data| DataLake
    TrainWorker2 -->|save model| S3Artifacts
    DeploySvc -->|load model| S3Artifacts
    DeploySvc -->|register| ModelRegistry[(PostgreSQL Model Registry)]
    DeploySvc -->|spin up| ModelServer[Model Serving Pod]
    PredictGW -->|route| ModelServer
    ModelServer -->|inference| Model1[/Model v1/]
    ModelServer -->|canary| Model2[/Model v2 Canary/]
    ModelServer -->|feature lookup| FeatureDB
    ModelServer -->|log prediction| KafkaPred>Kafka predictions]
    KafkaPred -->|consume| DriftWorker[Drift Detection Worker]
    DriftWorker -->|compare| DriftDB[(PostgreSQL Drift Stats)]
    DriftWorker -->|alert| DriftAlert[Drift Alert Service]
    KafkaPred -->|consume| RetrainTrigger[Retrain Trigger]
    RetrainTrigger -->|queue| TrainQueue
    DataPipeline[Data Pipeline Airflow] -->|ingest| DataLake
    DataPipeline -->|transform| FeatureDB
    Prom[Prometheus] -->|scrape| ModelServer
    Prom -->|alert| PagerDuty[PagerDuty]
    Prom -->|dashboard| Grafana[Grafana]

--- EXAMPLE 25: Multi-cloud disaster recovery platform ---
flowchart TD
    PrimaryRegion[AWS us-east-1 Primary] -->|replicate| SecondaryRegion[GCP us-central1 Standby]
    PrimaryRegion -->|replicate| TertiaryRegion[Azure eastus DR]
    User[End User] -->|GeoDNS| TrafficMgr{{Global Traffic Manager}}
    TrafficMgr -->|active| PrimaryGW{{AWS ALB Primary}}
    TrafficMgr -->|failover| SecondaryGW{{GCP Load Balancer}}
    PrimaryGW -->|route| PrimaryAPI[Primary API Cluster]
    PrimaryAPI -->|write| PrimaryDB[(Aurora PostgreSQL Primary)]
    PrimaryDB -->|binlog replication| SecondaryDB[(Cloud SQL PostgreSQL Replica)]
    PrimaryDB -->|binlog replication| TertiaryDB[(Azure PostgreSQL Replica)]
    PrimaryAPI -->|write| PrimaryRedis([Redis Primary])
    PrimaryRedis -->|replicate| SecondaryRedis([Redis Replica GCP])
    PrimaryAPI -->|publish| KafkaPrimary>Kafka Primary MSK]
    KafkaPrimary -->|mirror maker| KafkaSecondary>Kafka GCP Mirror]
    PrimaryAPI -->|files| S3Primary[/S3 us-east-1/]
    S3Primary -->|cross-region| S3Secondary[/S3 GCP Bucket/]
    S3Primary -->|cross-region| S3Tertiary[/Azure Blob Storage/]
    HealthMonitor[Health Monitor] -->|check| PrimaryAPI
    HealthMonitor -->|check| SecondaryGW
    HealthMonitor -->|failover trigger| DNSUpdater[DNS Failover Service]
    DNSUpdater -->|update| TrafficMgr
    DNSUpdater -->|promote replica| SecondaryDB
    BackupSvc[Backup Service] -->|daily snapshot| PrimaryDB
    BackupSvc -->|encrypt| KMS[AWS KMS]
    BackupSvc -->|store| S3Backups[/S3 Backup Vault/]
    BackupSvc -->|verify restore| RestoreTest[Restore Test Runner]
    RPO[RPO Monitor] -->|measure lag| SecondaryDB
    RPO -->|alert if exceeded| PagerDuty[PagerDuty]
    Prom[Prometheus] -->|multi-region| Grafana[Grafana Global Dashboard]
    Grafana -->|runbook| Runbook[Runbook Automation]
    Runbook -->|execute| DNSUpdater

"""

PARAMETER temperature 0.1
PARAMETER num_predict 8000
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER stop "```"
PARAMETER stop "Here is"
PARAMETER stop "Here's"
PARAMETER stop "This diagram"
PARAMETER stop "The above"
PARAMETER stop "Note:"
PARAMETER stop "I've created"
PARAMETER stop "As you can see"
PARAMETER stop "--- EXAMPLE"
